DATA PROVENANCE & ORIGINAL SOURCES:

This dataset aggregates data from multiple public sources:

1. EMK Handbook (emk_spec_verified tier, 753 rows)
   - Source: EMK Handbook of Steels (public technical specifications)
   - Original license: Public domain (specification values)

2. NIMS Japan (nims_measured tier, 360 rows)
   - Source: National Institute for Materials Science, Japan
   - Original license: Public domain (government research data)
   - URL: https://dice.nims.go.jp/

3. Kaggle Datasets (kaggle_measured tier, 247 rows)
   - Sources: Various Kaggle steel property datasets
   - Original licenses: CC-BY or Public Domain

